  "name": "Spinning Lance (Ex)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 12th level, a dragoon gains the ability to spin his lance, allowing him to deflect incoming attacks.</p><p>Immediately after his attack or full-attack action, the dragoon gains a shield bonus to his AC equal to the number of successful attacks he made with his polearm or spear in that round. If the dragoon is wearing a shield, the shield bonus to AC stacks, but he only gains half the benefit (minimum +1). This effect lasts for 1 round, but may be extended by an additional round if he utilizes a total defense action in the round thereafter. The dragoon does not retain this bonus if he is rendered helpless or is knocked prone.</p>",
